message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Auto-KGR Research Studio"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Cheddy
    given-names: Hastika
repository-code: "https://github.com/hastikacheddy/dft-research-studio"
abstract: >-
  A neuro-symbolic framework that combines Large Language Models with a
  knowledge graph of Density Functional Theory (DFT) benchmark literature to
  compare 11 retrieval architectures (pure LLM, standard IR, graph-based) on a
  120-question stratified challenge set under five distractor-noise levels.
keywords:
  - density functional theory
  - knowledge graph
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - GraphRAG
  - quantum chemistry
preferred-citation:
  type: thesis
  thesis-type: "MSc dissertation"
  title: "Auto-KGR: An Autonomous Knowledge-Graph-Driven Reasoning Framework for Scientific Meta-Engineering in Quantum Chemistry"
  authors:
